    "details": {
      "alignment": "Unaligned",
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
        "subtype": "golem"
      },
      "cr": 7,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet — Raventree Iron Colossus.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>raventree-iron-colossus</code>): Large construct (golem), Unaligned; CR 7 (proficiency +3, to hit +9 with STR); AC 17 (carved iron &amp; granite mantle), hit points 126 (12d10+60), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Ancient stone-and-iron guardians constructed centuries ago by House Corvinarus to protect their ancestral seat. Repurposed by Byscilla Danos using command keys to lock down the manor's central hall.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> estate sentinel · <strong>tier:</strong> Ancient Manor Guardian · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Heavy Beasts &amp; Auxiliaries.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/regal-lion/raventree-iron-colossus.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 610013, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A towering, ancient 12-foot-tall iron-and-black-granite colossus construct sculpted in the gothic likeness of a hooded knight. Its chest is carved with the Corvinarus raventree crest glowing with crimson warding runes. Massive stone and iron pillar-like arms. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
